WEBVTT

00:00:59.561 --> 00:01:04.450
All of his words about
the responsibility that we have as humans

00:01:04.474 --> 00:01:06.514
to live in balance with nature

00:01:06.538 --> 00:01:08.106
were passed down to me.

00:01:08.585 --> 00:01:11.991
I noticed the universal
disconnect to our planet

00:01:12.015 --> 00:01:14.879
and remembered what you once told me:

00:01:14.903 --> 00:01:17.769
"Leave everything better
than you found it."

00:01:18.625 --> 00:01:21.650
I know you were talking about the dishes,

00:01:21.674 --> 00:01:24.447
but of course, that applies
to the planet as well.

00:01:24.967 --> 00:01:26.853
I didn't know what to do at first.

00:01:27.198 --> 00:01:28.514
The world is so big,

00:01:28.538 --> 00:01:30.744
and it has so many bad habits.